/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Terrain\040modelling\040and\040analysis\040using\040laser\040scanner\040data)
/Author (M\056\040Elmqvist\054\040E\056\040Jungert\054\040F\056\040Lantz)
/Subject (Very\040detailed\040high\055resolution\040\0503D\051\040digital\040terrain\040models\040can\040be\040obtained\040using\040airborne\040laser\040scanner\040data\056\040However\054\040laser\040scanning\040usually\040entails\040huge\040data\040sets\040even\040for\040moderate\040areas\054\040making\040data\040management\040and\040analysis\040both\040complex\040and\040time\040consuming\056\040For\040this\040reason\054\040automatic\040terrain\040modelling\040and\040efficient\040storage\040structures\040supporting\040data\040access\040are\040needed\056\040In\040this\040paper\040a\040number\040of\040methods\040supporting\040automatic\040construction\040of\0403D\040digital\040terrain\040models\054\040especially\040ground\040surface\040modelling\040and\040detection\040and\040measurement\040of\040individual\040trees\040will\040be\040discussed\056\040Furthermore\040automatic\040and\057or\040interactive\040terrain\040feature\040analysis\040will\040be\040discussed\056\040A\040special\040data\040representation\040structure\040for\040the\040terrain\040model\040allowing\040efficient\040data\040storage\040and\040data\040access\040will\040be\040presented\056\040Beside\040this\054\040it\040is\040possible\040to\040create\040a\040symbolic\040information\040structure\040from\040the\040terrain\040model\040that\040can\040be\040used\040in\040queries\040for\040determination\040of\040different\040terrain\040features\054\040such\040as\040ditches\040or\040ridges\040etc\056\054\040but\040also\040for\040detection\040of\040changes\040in\040the\040terrain\056)
/Keywords (01\040Jan\0402001\054\040Terrain\040rendering\054\040Terrain\054\040Raised\055relief\040map\054\040Laser\040scanning\054\040Swedish\040Defence\040Research\040Agency)
>>
